# Nuxt 3 / Vue 3 Frontend Conventions

## Component Structure
```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
// 1. Imports
// 2. Props/Emits
// 3. Composables (useI18n, useSeoMeta, useRoute...)
// 4. Reactive state
// 5. Computed
// 6. Methods
// 7. Lifecycle (onMounted nếu cần)
</script>

<template>
  <!-- Single root element hoặc Fragment -->
</template>
```

## File Naming
```
components/
  AppHeader.vue         # PascalCase, prefix App cho global
  ThemeProvider.vue
  sections/
    HeroSlider.vue      # PascalCase
    ServiceGrid.vue
composables/
  useTheme.ts           # camelCase với prefix use
  useBookingForm.ts
```

## SEO — mọi page phải có
```vue
<script setup>
useSeoMeta({
  title: computed(() => pageData.value?.title ?? 'Thăng Long Chè Việt'),
  description: computed(() => pageData.value?.description),
  ogTitle: ...,
  ogImage: ...,
})
</script>
```

## Performance — bắt buộc
```vue
<!-- Lazy load component nặng -->
const HeavyChart = defineAsyncComponent(() => import('~/components/HeavyChart.vue'))

<!-- Image: luôn dùng NuxtImg, không dùng <img> raw cho content images -->
<NuxtImg src="..." sizes="100vw sm:50vw lg:400px" loading="lazy" format="webp" />

<!-- Prefetch trang quan trọng -->
<NuxtLink prefetch href="/dich-vu">Dịch vụ</NuxtLink>
```

## Theme Engine — inject CSS variables
```ts
// composables/useTheme.ts
export function useTheme() {
  const applyTheme = (config: ThemeConfig) => {
    const root = document.documentElement
    root.style.setProperty('--color-primary', config.colors.primary)
    root.style.setProperty('--font-heading', config.typography.heading)
  }
  return { applyTheme }
}
```

## Page Template Registry
```ts
// utils/templateRegistry.ts
export const templateRegistry: Record<string, Component> = {
  'home-hero-slider': defineAsyncComponent(() => import('~/templates/HomeHeroSlider.vue')),
  'home-video-bg':    defineAsyncComponent(() => import('~/templates/HomeVideoBg.vue')),
  'services-grid':    defineAsyncComponent(() => import('~/templates/ServicesGrid.vue')),
  // Thêm template mới tại đây
}
```

## API Calls — luôn dùng useFetch / useAsyncData
```ts
// ✅ ĐÚNG: SSR-compatible, cache tự động
const { data: page } = await useAsyncData(
  `page-${slug}`,
  () => $fetch(`/api/pages/${slug}?lang=${locale.value}`)
)

// ❌ SAI: chỉ chạy client-side
onMounted(() => { fetch('/api/pages/...') })
```

## Error Handling
```vue
<script setup>
const { data, error } = await useAsyncData(...)
if (error.value) throw createError({ statusCode: 404 })
</script>
```
